{
 "ez_index": 253,
 "name": "ST46MILITARY.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Jamaican",
  "\"Losing half your mobile suits...",
  " you call yourselves Titans,",
  " but it's in name only...\"",
  "Jerid",
  "\"Commander!\"",
  "\"Lila's squad is",
  " doing a better job!\"",
  "Lila",
  "\"With all due respect...\"",
  "\"You're covering for Jerid?\"",
  "\"No.",
  " This enemy is special;",
  " I need you to understand that.\"",
  "\"I don't follow.\"",
  "\"I never knew the White Base",
  " of old, but...\"",
  "\"That Argama",
  " looks to me just like",
  " that White Base.\"",
  "\"What makes you feel that way?\"",
  "\"The Argama's guard",
  " seems wide open, but get",
  " close and it's solid...\"",
  "\"The Gundam Mk-II above all:",
  " it may look untrained,",
  " but when you clash with it,\"",
  "\"its resistance feels",
  " overwhelming.\"",
  "\"They may be",
  " Newtypes...\"",
  "\"Don't talk nonsense!",
  " There's no such thing!\"",
  "\"Newtypes are a fantasy",
  " of novelists and video makers!\"",
  "The Argama escaped",
  "every Titans pursuit,",
  "slipped through the Shoal Zone",
  "and made it to the Moon.",
  "That the AEUG's base was likely",
  "the Moon was a view shared",
  "throughout the Titans.",
  "A colony is finished",
  "once a bulkhead is breached;",
  "the Moon is different.",
  "Whatever else it lacks,",
  "it has solid ground.",
  "The underground cities built there",
  "were so sturdy",
  "they rivaled Jaburo",
  "or Luna II.",
  "Open lunar cities such as",
  "Von Braun and Granada",
  "were one thing,",
  "but across the Moon, most of",
  "the mining bases and production",
  "sites the Lunarians had busily built",
  "were veiled in trade secrecy,",
  "and their full extent",
  "was scarcely known.",
  "Above all, the Lunarians were",
  "a people who, since before",
  "the Universal Century, had settled",
  "the Moon and made it their land.",
  "Their unity and kinship",
  "were said to surpass even",
  "those of colony citizens.",
  "That such a people, terrified",
  "by the colony massacre,",
  "should back the AEUG",
  "was surely a natural course.",
  "\"I know you're in there!",
  " Lieutenant! Open up!\"",
  "\"What do you want?",
  " You've got no business here!\"",
  "\"In front of Jamaican,",
  " you made me...!\"",
  "\"...! S-sorry...\"",
  "Calling on Lila in her quarters,",
  "Jerid saw her in her private wear",
  "and turned red.",
  "He was an innocent youth at heart.",
  "\"What about",
  " Jamaican?\"",
  "\"I told you I'd be running",
  " the Titans someday, right?\"",
  "\"For that, I want to handle even",
  " Jamaican on my own.\"",
  "\"And you go and act like",
  " you're covering for me...\"",
  "\"That's not like",
  " the woman who lectured me,",
  " now, is it?\"",
  "\"You really didn't listen",
  " to a word I said, did you.\"",
  "\"!?\"",
  "\"I was explaining",
  " the facts about the Argama.\"",
  "\"I wasn't thinking",
  " about you at all.\"",
  "The Woman and the Boy",
  "The MS Called Marasai",
  "\"The Galbaldy team,",
  " on the Alexandria...\"",
  "\"We must work to repay",
  " every repair you gave us.\"",
  "\"We aren't Titans,",
  " after all.\"",
  "\"We'll return to the Bosnia,",
  " pursue the Argama another way,",
  " and stop it in its tracks.\"",
  "\"A fine resolve, but...",
  " don't rush in once you find them.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant, I hear you're",
  " the type who loves war.\"",
  "\"...! That's prejudice, Commander.\"",
  "\"Very well.",
  " If you do make contact,",
  " the call is yours, but\"",
  "\"I'm counting on you",
  " to rejoin us!\"",
  "\"Sir! Let's go!\"",
  "Lila Milla Rira",
  "was no Earth supremacist;",
  "far from it, she was born in space.",
  "The Luna II forces",
  "she had served with",
  "were among the very first",
  "in the One Year War",
  "to put MS into combat.",
  "When Gihren Zabi gave his memorial",
  "address, she was already fighting",
  "Zeon in an early GM squad.",
  "They were a band of die-hard MS",
  "pilots; to come up from Luna II",
  "was a byword for veteran.",
  "What were the Titans, with no one",
  "raised in space? So she thought;",
  "if anything, her views were closer",
  "to the AEUG's.",
  "Yet she took a liking to Jerid,",
  "an honor student full of drive",
  "but lacking the skill to match.",
  "It was not love or romance.",
  "In the One Year War,",
  "she had been asked to fill",
  "a man's role;",
  "now, being able to mother someone",
  "gave her joy.",
  "And that",
  "was what got her killed so young.",
  "\"Lieutenant Lila!",
  " Now do you see?\"",
  "\"I knew all about",
  " Jamaican.\"",
  "\"Then why'd you",
  " push him so hard?\"",
  "\"That he's all talk--",
  " that's what I wanted",
  " you to understand.\"",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"...Lila!",
  " Next time we meet,",
  " how about a nice, slow drink!\"",
  "\"I might consider it.\"",
  "\"Thanks...\"",
  "\"If you grow into a good man,",
  " I can lean on you over a drink.",
  " That's a fine thing...\"",
  "\"You've got what it takes",
  " to be a good man,",
  " you know...\"",
  "Around this time,",
  "the mobile suit rushed into",
  "service with the Titans",
  "was the Marasai.",
  "The Titans had",
  "their own development arm",
  "and did build mobile suits,",
  "but until 0087,",
  "their mainstay remained",
  "the GM Quel, the mass-produced",
  "Gundam NT-1,",
  "and, a hybrid of Zaku and GM,",
  "the Hizack.",
  "These machines",
  "did outclass the GM II, the",
  "minor-change model used",
  "by regular Federation units,",
  "but they were plainly inferior",
  "in fundamental performance.",
  "At the time,",
  "the Titans did not have",
  "the technology for armor",
  "using Gundarium Gamma,",
  "an evolution of",
  "the Luna Titanium",
  "used on the Gundam.",
  "Gundarium was called",
  "Gamma because, counting",
  "Luna Titanium as Alpha,",
  "it had been improved",
  "twice over.",
  "The man who named it was",
  "an engineer of the Zeon remnants",
  "who had been put through hell",
  "by the Gundam, but he, at least,",
  "must have rated the Gundam's",
  "performance fairly.",
  "He had seen that its mobility",
  "came from the sturdiness",
  "of its structural materials.",
  "Gundarium Gamma",
  "was stronger",
  "than Luna Titanium",
  "and, above all, lighter.",
  "That the Rick Dias, ponderous",
  "as it looked at first glance,",
  "and the Nemo, which seemed little",
  "different from a GM, could fight",
  "at an advantage against the many",
  "Titans mobile suits was",
  "thanks to this Gundarium Gamma",
  "technology from Char,",
  "which they had acquired.",
  "Yet the Marasai",
  "was equipped with it.",
  "Anaheim, suspected of being",
  "the AEUG's parent company,",
  "had supplied the Marasai,",
  "still in development,",
  "to the Titans.",
  "Judging from its design,",
  "modeled on the Zaku,",
  "it may originally have been,",
  "with the Nemo, the AEUG's",
  "mass-produced mobile suit, set to",
  "inherit the Zaku's role as symbol",
  "of the people of space.",
  "But the AEUG",
  "did not insist on it.",
  "It judged it more worthwhile",
  "to build Gundarium into the",
  "superb design of the Gundam Mk-II.",
  "Still,",
  "even this mobile suit",
  "had mobility, firepower and armor",
  "far beyond the mobile suits",
  "the Titans had used",
  "up to then,",
  "and so, with frontline soldiers",
  "like Jerid, it proved",
  "generally popular.",
  "Captain",
  "\"Anaheim went and provided us",
  " with that mobile suit,",
  " the Marasai.\"",
  "\"Nothing's costlier than free.\"",
  "\"It may be one they'd been using",
  " to test mobile suits",
  " meant for the AEUG.\"",
  "\"And on top of that, Anaheim",
  " will supply the AEUG with even",
  " better mobile suits?\"",
  "\"That way,",
  " whichever side wins,",
  " they can say they were allies...\"",
  "\"Heh...!\"",
  "\"All a soldier needs is a loud voice,",
  " isn't that right?\"",
  "Kacricon",
  "\"Hang on to your pride, and",
  " tomorrow the Gundam kills you.\"",
  "\"I'd rather not admit it.\"",
  "\"But a loss is a loss!\"",
  "\"...Jamaican says he'll allow",
  " a sortie, as long as it doubles",
  " as a test of the Marasai.\"",
  "\"For me?\"",
  "\"Yeah, so how about",
  " going along with my plan?\"",
  "\"Plan?\"",
  "\"Two units attacking as if one:",
  " a staggered strike.\"",
  "\"Forget about women for now.\"",
  "\"I'm not that far gone",
  " over Lila.\"",
  "But the Titans' attack",
  "ended having achieved nothing.",
  "Not only had they let",
  "the Argama escape;",
  "they had only managed to feed",
  "the Lunarians' resentment.",
  "In the string of short straws",
  "since the theft of the Gundam,",
  "the senior officers who knew of",
  "Operation Stardust",
  "sensed an ill omen,",
  "and their tempers soured."
 ]
}
